nt hover:text-white\" href=\"/vlast\">Властта</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Кой как гласува, закони, партии, депутати\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/parlament\">Парламент</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво обещаха правителствата и какво стана\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/obeshtaniya\">Обещания</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Вярно ли е казаното, корупционни дела\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/proverki\">Проверки</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Приходи, разходи, дълг\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/byudzhet\">Бюджет</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Договори, фирми, риск, връзки с политици\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/porachki\">Поръчки</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Растеж, инфлация, заплати, жилища\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/ikonomika\">Икономика</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Цените в магазините по вериги и места\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/ceni\">Цени</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Вашата община: пари, поръчки, съвет\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/mesta\">Места</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/ikonomika\">← <!-- -->Икономика</a></p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Европейски средства</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Всички договори с европейски пари от регистъра ИСУН: от кои фондове, по кои програми, за кого и в коя община. Колко е договорено и колко е реално изплатено.</div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Договорени</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">46,13 млрд. €</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">83 291 договора</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Изплатени</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">20,19 млрд. €</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">44% от договореното</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Бенефициенти</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">53 182</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">фирми, общини, ведомства, НПО</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">На държавата и общините</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">63%</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">от договорените пари</p></div></div><section class=\"mb-14\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Усвояване: договорено срещу изплатено</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Програмен период 2014–2020</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-2\">78<!-- -->%</p><div class=\"h-2.5 rounded-full bg-surface mt-2 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:78.05%\"></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-2\">10,86 млрд. €<!-- --> изплатени от <!-- -->13,92 млрд. €<!-- --> договорени</p></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Програмен период 2021–2027</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-2\">30<!-- -->%</p><div class=\"h-2.5 rounded-full bg-surface mt-2 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:30.17%\"></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-2\">4,3 млрд. €<!-- --> изплатени от <!-- -->14,27 млрд. €<!-- --> договорени</p></div><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">План за възстановяване (ПВУ)</p><p class=\"display text-[2.6rem] leading-none mt-2\">31<!-- -->%</p><div class=\"h-2.5 rounded-full bg-surface mt-2 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full bg-green\" style=\"width:30.6%\"></div></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-2\">5,49 млрд. €<!-- --> изплатени от <!-- -->17,94 млрд. €<!-- --> договорени</p></div></div><p class=\"text-[15px] mt-4 max-w-3xl\">Най-голямото перо е Планът за възстановяване. Срокът за изпълнение на инвестициите по него е 31 август 2026 г. (<a href=\"https://www.bta.bg/bg/videos/37417\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">БТА</a>), а по регистъра е изплатена под една трета. Неизплатеното не е непременно загубено: плащанията към бенефициентите често се отразяват със закъснение. Но това е мястото, където рискът от загубени пари е най-голям.</p></section><section class=\"mb-14\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Откъде идват и по кои програми</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Фондовете на ЕС вляво, програмите вдясно, по договорената сума. Показани са най-големите програми.</p><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-hidden relative\"><svg width=\"900\" height=\"1160\" class=\"block max-w-full\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Паричен поток\"><defs><pattern id=\"hatch\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><rect width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#e7efea\"></rect><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#9aa39e\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line></pattern></defs><path d=\"M17,152.19483475627052C350,152.19483475627052,350,152.19483475627052,683,152.19483475627052\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f6f8f\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"288.38966951254105\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,365.6656893848086C350,365.6656893848086,350,351.06304061513157,683,351.06304061513157\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c46a4a\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"69.34674220518102\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,422.53382930060224C350,422.53382930060224,350,427.9311805309251,683,427.9311805309251\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c46a4a\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"44.38953762640617\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,462.6439178382309C350,462.6439178382309,350,488.04126906855373,683,488.04126906855373\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c46a4a\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"35.83063944885111\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,494.9095783945028C350,494.9095783945028,350,540.3069296248257,683,540.3069296248257\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c46a4a\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"28.70068166369268\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,522.6637984184022C350,522.6637984184022,350,588.0611496487252,683,588.0611496487252\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c46a4a\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"26.807758384106126\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,549.0389128827348C350,549.0389128827348,350,634.4362641130579,683,634.4362641130579\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c46a4a\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"25.942470544559164\" style=\"cursor:pointer;transition:stroke-opacity .15s\"></path><path d=\"M17,659.0309085388383C350,659.0309085388383,350,691.3588461665362,683,691.3588461665362\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f7d57\" stroke-opacity=\"0.38\" stroke-width=\"47.902693562397495\" s