/NIF\">Национален иновационен фонд</a></td><td class=\"p-3 text-sm\">2014-20</td><td class=\"p-3 num\">0,6 млн. €</td><td class=\"p-3 num\">0 млн. €</td><td class=\"p-3 num text-red\">0<!-- -->%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section><section class=\"mb-14\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Къде отиват: по общини</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Договорени средства на човек от населението. Проекти, които обхващат няколко общини, са разделени поравно между тях. Националните проекти (пътища, железници) не са включени.</p><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full min-h-[200px]\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Зареждане на картата…</p></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 mt-6\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Най-много на човек</p><ol class=\"text-[15px]\"><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Брусарци</span><span class=\"num\">19 187<!-- --> € · <!-- -->78,6 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Гълъбово</span><span class=\"num\">16 792<!-- --> € · <!-- -->184,2 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Златица</span><span class=\"num\">15 587<!-- --> € · <!-- -->77,4 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Камено</span><span class=\"num\">12 740<!-- --> € · <!-- -->121,6 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Тунджа</span><span class=\"num\">12 302<!-- --> € · <!-- -->260,4 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Невестино</span><span class=\"num\">11 146<!-- --> € · <!-- -->20,3 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Брезник</span><span class=\"num\">10 544<!-- --> € · <!-- -->61,2 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Мизия</span><span class=\"num\">10 180<!-- --> € · <!-- -->57,9 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Бобошево</span><span class=\"num\">9532<!-- --> € · <!-- -->22,4 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Бобов дол</span><span class=\"num\">9144<!-- --> € · <!-- -->62,7 млн. €</span></li></ol></div><div><p class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Най-малко на човек</p><ol class=\"text-[15px]\"><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Кричим</span><span class=\"num\">808<!-- --> € · <!-- -->5,9 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Своге</span><span class=\"num\">944<!-- --> € · <!-- -->18,3 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Стамболийски</span><span class=\"num\">1010<!-- --> € · <!-- -->18,3 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Руен</span><span class=\"num\">1058<!-- --> € · <!-- -->27,9 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Годеч</span><span class=\"num\">1060<!-- --> € · <!-- -->5,2 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Кирково</span><span class=\"num\">1089<!-- --> € · <!-- -->22,3 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Якоруда</span><span class=\"num\">1188<!-- --> € · <!-- -->11,4 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Тетевен</span><span class=\"num\">1212<!-- --> € · <!-- -->21,8 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Ракитово</span><span class=\"num\">1216<!-- --> € · <!-- -->16,4 млн. €</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Венец</span><span class=\"num\">1223<!-- --> € · <!-